  "title": "Slow Cooker Northern White Bean Bacon Chowder",
  "description": "White beans which have been cooked in a slow cooker with bacon, aromatic vegetables, seasonings and chicken broth are pureed in a blender and thinned with milk in this recipe for a savory chowder.",
  "authors": [
    "CORWYNN DARKHOLME"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-04-30T20:19:10-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2019-04-03T23:25:32-04:00",
